Not clean: CSharpier puts back what BRO1519 changes in ArchUnitNET/Domain/Architecture.cs, so the two formatters undo each other there and no run settles it. Set it to none where CSharpier formats (dotnet_diagnostic.BRO1519.severity = none in .editorconfig), and please report it: https://github.com/bisforboman/stylebro/issues.
